			"notes": {
				"rationale": "Darf is the modal dürfen, a VERB with a meaning of its own, one Lemma whether it governs an infinitive or an object; the infinitive it governs, bitten, is a target of its own (de/modal-is-a-verb, ADR 0026). With um Ruhe, Darf ich … bitten? is no formula (target 2)."
			},
